OL,3,ASwinney suggests Scots will not travel
OL,4,Afurther for health care under reforms
OL,5,
OL,6,FScots should not have to travel further
OL,7,Ffor health care under the government's
OL,8,Fplans to cut the number of health
OL,9,Fboards from 14 to two, John Swinney has
OL,10,Fsuggested.
OL,12,FThe BBC asked the first minister about
OL,13,Fthe impact of such changes for people
OL,14,Fwho are already travelling long
OL,15,Fdistances - such as women living in the
OL,16,Ffar north who have to travel 100 miles
OL,17,Fdown the A9 to give birth in Inverness.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
