OL,3,ASwinney suggests Scots will not travel
OL,4,Afurther for health care under reforms
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney said it would "not be my
OL,7,Fintention" for people to travel
OL,8,Ffurther, with initial modelling showing
OL,9,Fthe country divided into two east and
OL,10,Fwest health boards.
OL,12,FHe also said he could not put a
OL,13,F"specific figure" on NHS job losses,
OL,14,Fbut he had been "open about the fact
OL,15,Fthat public sector employment will
OL,16,Ffall".
